  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">ArtWeek</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4461 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-artweek category-education category-events category-news tag-art-and-community tag-artweekma tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce\" id=\"post-4461\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/community-painting-unveiling/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman putting paintings\" src=\"/media/archive/bf9d7f2cbfceffbddc3644287761deb1e4e620a6f0013cf8ab647e814b7c548d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/community-painting-unveiling/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Community Painting Unveiling</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-06-27T21:50:20-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, June 27, 2019, 9:50 pm\">June 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists will unveil the Mystery Painting Puzzle at 4:30 pm, Saturday June 29th at the Harwich Chamber of Commerce Welcome Center in Harwich Port.  </p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3761 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-artweekma tag-donna-julian-spillane tag-doris-mee tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-meet-the-artist tag-robin-litwin tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3761\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" alt=\"A blank white image.\" src=\"/media/archive/756fb9062dc3b8319cf9143d170258ae733c4c39396c5a3879bbaaf72f244534.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">May Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-01T01:21:11-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, May 1, 2018, 1:21 am\">May 1, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>At the Guild meeting on April 21, members voted and approved of by-law changes which included: Guild membership is expanded to include residents or taxpayers of Barnstable County A “quorum” <a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3752 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-events category-gallery-artists category-news tag-chris-banks tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-toast-of-harwich tag-wequassett\" id=\"post-3752\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"838\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a group of people dancing.\" src=\"/media/archive/59b43ea8321581b0f324b9fe4ddc1f86e86ddc9a01e1cae6a4b86841c7a75479.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\" rel=\"bookmark\">17th Annual Toast of Harwich</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-28T22:23:24-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 28, 2018, 10:23 pm\">April 28, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The 17th Annual Toast of Harwich was held Friday, April 27 at the Wequassett Resort &amp; Golf Club. It was a very busy night with music, lots of food and <a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3741 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-events category-news tag-artweekma tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3741\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-members-play-for-artweek/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A group of people playing music.\" src=\"/media/archive/8dc63b26c7b4a7f866cf24d2fb46053b9dae5dd33b8fc2c612bb40d8b35e92e0.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-members-play-for-artweek/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Members Play for ArtWeek</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-26T11:22:23-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, April 26, 2018, 11:22 am\">April 26, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Saturday morning, April 28th, Guild members Carroll Sivco and Elaine Felos Ostrander are members of the Cape Cod Ukulele Club will be performing at 11 Am in the new Harwich <a href=\"/news/guild-members-play-for-artweek/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3712 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-news tag-creative-arts-center tag-family-pantry-of-cape-cod tag-hrwich-cultural-center tag-robin-litwin\" id=\"post-3712\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-member-robin-litwin-offers-encaustic-instruction/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"848\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A group of people holding up their paintings in front of a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/b3414b5ff4822236a7666b5494414c7eab8e1ef25f88437948fee23f500c02de.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-member-robin-litwin-offers-encaustic-instruction/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Member Robin Litwin Offers Encaustic Instruction</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-18T12:38:45-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, April 18, 2018, 12:38 pm\">April 18, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>I have been loving encaustic painting for the past five years and want to thank Mary Moquin for helping me in countless ways; she is the most generous and gifted <a href=\"/news/guild-member-robin-litwin-offers-encaustic-instruction/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3705 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-news tag-artweek tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-robin-litwin\" id=\"post-3705\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"548\" height=\"410\" alt=\"©Robin Litwin, Bartletts on Turquoise\" src=\"/media/archive/f80ded191ea06dad5823e53a34595e7ffcc2468dfb0b265fcd12dea007e11e93.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Robin Litwin Demonstrates Encaustic Painting for ArtWeek</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-05T20:28:18-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, April 5, 2018, 8:28 pm\">April 5, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>New member of The Guild of Harwich Artists, Robin Litwin is a Harwich artist and photographer. In 2008, she retired from a 25-year career teaching in the Art Department at <a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is n